      description : "1.8 SSH Strong Algorithm - h) Disable hmac none"
      info        : "Disable the weak algorithm of the ssh to interact with the client through the strong algorithm in the ssh connection, and provide security protection for the ZTE Router Platform series products."
      solution    : "Disable the ssh weak algorithm:

      ZXR10 (config)#ssh server hmac none disable"
